WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
This is my Simple Calculator, built in Python.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
I type 12 as the first number and choose +.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Next, I enter 30 as the second number.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The calculator displays the answer: 42.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
This concludes the calculator demonstration.
